WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.051 --> 00:00:01.780
(birds chirping)

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.180
- [Narrator] The people
of Singapore love birds,

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.456
and none more so than this man.

00:00:07.456 --> 00:00:10.373
(foreign language)

00:00:23.372 --> 00:00:26.122
(cheerful music)

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.920
This is Ting Lang Fu, the
owner of one of Singapore's

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.622
premier birdcage making shops.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:41.539
(foreign language)

00:01:29.026 --> 00:01:32.350
Many of Lang Fu's cages can
be found across the street,

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:35.493
at a gathering of the Kebun
Baru Birdsinging Club.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.680
Each weekend, the club sees Singaporeans

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.583
from all over coming together.

00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:45.826
(foreign language)

00:02:09.512 --> 00:02:10.950
But people do more than just sit

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.170
and admire the beautiful birds.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.800
Frequently, there are
bird singing competitions,

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:18.720
where a variety of birds are
judged on singing ability,

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:22.333
tonal quality, stamina,
liveliness and beauty.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.997
(foreign language)

00:03:14.853 --> 00:03:17.436
(upbeat music)

